<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel"> 
      <p xml:id="Aink194-kilavi">
       pakaṟkuṟikkaṇ vantunīṅkun talaimakaṉait tōḻi etirppaṭṭu maṉaikkaṇ nikaṉtatukūṟic ceṟippaṟivuṟīi varaivukaṭāyatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
       The confidante having suggested marriage, having encountered the hero who left, having come from the daytime meeting place, telling [him about] the things that happened at home [and] informing [him of her] confinement.</p>
  </div> 
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink194">
<l>kaṭaṟkō ṭaṟutta varampō ḻavvaḷai</l>
<l>yoṇṭoṭi maṭavaraṟ kaṇṭikuṅ koṇka</l>
<l>naṉṉuta liṉṟumāl ceyteṉak</l>
<l>koṉṉoṉṟu kaṭuttaṉa ḷaṉṉaiyatu nilaiyē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>Oh man from the sea!</l>
        <l>We saw the innocent girl with bright bracelets</l>
        <l>[And]  filed, pretty bangles that were cut from sea-conches.</l>
        <l>Because the good forehead was made dark today,</l>
        <l>The state of mother [is such] — she is in doubt, [because of her] one fear.</l>      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
